            B.q("sa-m2-44", "sa-compute", "Licensing and compliance rules require that the VMs run on physical servers used by no other customer, with control over maintenance timing. What do you recommend?", listOf("Azure Dedicated Host", "Spot VMs", "An availability set", "A proximity placement group"), setOf(0), "Azure Dedicated Host gives you whole physical servers used only by your organisation. You place your VMs on them and can control when host maintenance happens.",
