            B.q("sa-m2-45", "sa-compute", "An in-memory analytics engine on VMs needs a high ratio of memory to CPU. Which VM family fits best?", listOf("F-series, compute optimised", "B-series, burstable", "E-series, memory optimised", "N-series, GPU"), setOf(2), "VM families are tuned for different needs. Memory optimised families such as the E-series give a high memory-to-CPU ratio, which suits in-memory databases, caches and analytics.",
