            B.q("sa-m2-47", "sa-app-architecture", "One order event must reach billing, shipping and analytics, and each consumer wants only certain orders, such as shipping only physical goods. What do you recommend?", listOf("A Service Bus queue with three receivers", "A Service Bus topic with a subscription per consumer, each with a filter", "Three storage queues written by the sender", "One event hub partition per consumer"), setOf(1), "A Service Bus topic gives each subscriber its own copy of each message through a subscription, and a subscription filter passes on only the messages that match, such as orders with physical items.",
                scenario = "Kitewing Books sells e-books and printed books through its Android app. Each order must go to billing, to analytics, and, only for printed books, to shipping.",
