            B.q("sa-m2-49", "sa-app-architecture", "APIs that must stay in the on-premises data centre need the same keys, policies and analytics as the cloud APIs, without sending traffic through Azure. What do you recommend?", listOf("Expose them directly on the internet", "Azure API Management with a self-hosted gateway on-premises", "A second API Management instance on-premises", "Azure Front Door"), setOf(1), "API Management's self-hosted gateway is a container you run on-premises or in another cloud. It applies the same policies as the cloud gateway and reports back to the same instance, while API traffic stays local.",
