            B.q("sa-m2-51", "sa-app-architecture", "Microservices read their settings from App Configuration, but database passwords must stay in Key Vault, and the apps should use one way of reading all configuration. What do you recommend?", listOf("Copy the passwords into App Configuration as plain values", "Key Vault references in App Configuration, resolved by the app's managed identity", "Store the passwords in environment variables of each container", "Store the passwords in the code repository, encrypted"), setOf(1), "A Key Vault reference is an App Configuration entry that points to a secret in Key Vault. The app reads it through the App Configuration provider and fetches the secret from Key Vault with its own identity, so secrets never sit in App Configuration.",
