            B.q("sa-m2-54", "sa-migrations", "Fifty terabytes on on-premises NFS shares must move to Blob Storage over the network, managed and tracked from the Azure portal, with incremental copies before the cutover. What do you recommend?", listOf("Azure Storage Mover with an agent on-premises", "Robocopy run by hand", "Azure File Sync", "Azure Import/Export with your own disks"), setOf(0), "Azure Storage Mover is a managed migration service: an agent on-premises copies NFS or SMB shares to Azure Storage, and jobs are defined, run and tracked from Azure. Later runs copy only what changed, ready for cutover.",
