            B.q("sa-m2-57", "sa-network-connectivity", "On-premises servers must resolve the names of Azure private endpoints, and Azure VMs must resolve on-premises names, without running DNS server VMs. What do you recommend?", listOf("Azure DNS Private Resolver with inbound and outbound endpoints", "Two DNS server VMs in the hub", "Add hosts file entries on every server", "Public DNS records for the private endpoints"), setOf(0), "Azure DNS Private Resolver is a managed service. On-premises DNS forwards queries to its inbound endpoint to resolve Azure private zones, and forwarding rules on its outbound endpoint send queries for on-premises names to the company's DNS servers.",
